For the 2024–25 season, the combined stadium capacity of the 20 Premier League clubs was 816,170, with an average of 40,809. At the end of the campaign, the league recorded the highest average match attendance of any association football league in the world, at 40,421 per game.<ref>{{cite web |url=https://global.espn.com/soccer/stats/_/league/ENG.1/season/2024/view/performance |title=English Premier League Performance Stats – 2024–25 |publisher=ESPN |access-date=19 June 2025 }}</ref><ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.weltfussball.de/zuschauer/eng-premier-league-2024-2025/1/ |title=Premier League 2024/25 » Attendance |publisher=weltfussball.de |access-date=25 May 2025}}</ref>

